# Characters-fastmode.ti59

# From TI PPC Notes v5n9-10 1980, https://airy.rskey.org/CALCDOCS//TI/PPC/V5N9-10.pdf

# The last one is a little more complex. It uses the fast mode and in this mode really goes to town.
# To use it, put it first on one side of a mag card. Then enter the card, press RST R/S, which initializes the fast mode.
# Then enter the card again and see the printing start. To show how slow normal mode is in comparison, press RST,
# which takes the program out of fast mode. Then press A.
# The same table is printed, but ever so siowly. Note also that this program prints the extended print code table.
# The author of this jewel is K-J Meusch, Koenigsdorf, West Germany.

# Prepare the magnet card inlay
CUECARD:
Template: MagnetCard
Title: Print Characters
Banks: 1
A: R/S after load, then reinsert card

PROGRAM:
